#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:6
msgid "Menuconfig Configuration Interface"
msgstr "Menuconfig 配置界面"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:8
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:10
msgid ""
"Menuconfig is UniSDK's terminal-based interactive system configuration "
"tool, providing visual menu navigation to set all Kconfig configuration "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Menuconfig 是 UniSDK 的基于终端的交互式系统配置工具，提供可视化菜单导航以设置所有 Kconfig 配置选项。"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:12
msgid "**Key Features:**"
msgstr "**主要特性：**"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:14
msgid ""
"Dual-phase configuration: Chip configuration and Build configuration are "
"separated"
msgstr "双阶段配置：芯片配置和构建配置相互分离"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:15
msgid "Terminal graphical interface with arrow key navigation"
msgstr "终端图形界面，支持方向键导航"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:16
msgid "Search function (press `/` key)"
msgstr "搜索功能（按 `/` 键）"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:17
msgid "Help system (press `?` key to view option descriptions)"
msgstr "帮助系统（按 `?` 键查看选项说明）"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:18
msgid ""
"Automatic dependency management (unavailable options are automatically "
"hidden)"
msgstr "自动依赖管理（不可用的选项自动隐藏）"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:19
msgid ""
"Merged output: Automatically merges hardware and software configurations "
"into `.config`"
msgstr "合并输出：自动将硬件和软件配置合并到 `.config`"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:21
msgid "Launch Methods"
msgstr "启动方式"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:38
msgid ""
"!!! note \"First-time Use\"     `make config` will open the interface "
"twice in sequence: first the chip configuration (Kconfig.chip), then the "
"peripheral build configuration (Kconfig.build)."
msgstr ""
"!!! note \"首次使用\"     `make config` 将依次打开两次界面：首先是芯片配置（Kconfig.chip），然后是外设构建配置（Kconfig.build）。"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:41
msgid "Navigation and Operations"
msgstr "导航与操作"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "Operation"
msgstr "操作"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "Key"
msgstr "按键"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "Move up/down"
msgstr "上/下移动"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "`↑` `↓` or `j` `k`"
msgstr "`↑` `↓` 或 `j` `k`"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "Enter submenu"
msgstr "进入子菜单"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "`Enter` or `→`"
msgstr "`Enter` 或 `→`"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "Return to parent"
msgstr "返回上级"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "`ESC` or `←`"
msgstr "`ESC` 或 `←`"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "Toggle option"
msgstr "切换选项"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "`Space`"
msgstr "`Space`"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "Search"
msgstr "搜索"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "`/`"
msgstr "`/`"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "View help"
msgstr "查看帮助"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "`?`"
msgstr "`?`"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "Save and exit"
msgstr "保存并退出"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "Select `< Save >` then `< Exit >`"
msgstr "选择 `< Save >` 然后选择 `< Exit >`"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:53
msgid "![Chip configuration screen](pics/menuconfig_1.png)"
msgstr "![芯片配置界面](pics/menuconfig_1.png)"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:53
msgid "Chip configuration screen"
msgstr "芯片配置界面"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:55
msgid "*Figure 1. Chip configuration screen — select target SoC and board*"
msgstr "*图 1. 芯片配置界面 — 选择目标 SoC 和开发板*"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:57
msgid "![Build configuration screen](pics/menuconfig_2.png)"
msgstr "![构建配置界面](pics/menuconfig_2.png)"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:57
msgid "Build configuration screen"
msgstr "构建配置界面"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:59
msgid ""
"*Figure 2. Build configuration screen — configure software drivers and "
"settings*"
msgstr "*图 2. 构建配置界面 — 配置软件驱动和设置*"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:61
msgid "Dual-Phase Configuration"
msgstr "双阶段配置"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:63
msgid "Phase 1: Chip Configuration (chip.config)"
msgstr "阶段 1：芯片配置（chip.config）"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:65
msgid "When the tool opens for the first time, you are configuring the hardware."
msgstr "当工具首次打开时，您正在配置硬件。"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:67
msgid "**What you see:** Options related to SoC Series, SoC, and Board"
msgstr "**您看到的内容：** 与 SoC 系列、SoC 和开发板相关的选项"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:68
msgid ""
"**Action:** Select your target SoC and enable required chip peripherals "
"(GPIO ports, UART instances, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"**操作：** 选择目标 SoC 并启用所需的芯片外设（GPIO 端口、UART 实例等）"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:69
msgid "**Exit:** Select `< Save >` and `< Exit >` to close the window"
msgstr "**退出：** 选择 `< Save >` 和 `< Exit >` 关闭窗口"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:71
msgid "Phase 2: Build Configuration (build.config)"
msgstr "阶段 2：构建配置（build.config）"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:73
msgid ""
"Immediately after the first window closes, the tool opens again for "
"software configuration."
msgstr "第一个窗口关闭后，工具会再次打开以进行软件配置。"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:75
msgid ""
"**What you see:** Options filtered based on chip capabilities "
"(`capabilities.h`), including API configurations, driver selections, and "
"feature switches"
msgstr ""
"**您看到的内容：** 根据芯片能力（`capabilities.h`）筛选后的选项，包括 API 配置、驱动选择和功能开关"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:76
msgid ""
"**Action:** Configure feature switches, parameters, examples, and "
"debugging options"
msgstr "**操作：** 配置功能开关、参数、示例和调试选项"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:77
msgid "**Exit:** Select `< Save >` and `< Exit >` to finish the process"
msgstr "**退出：** 选择 `< Save >` 和 `< Exit >` 完成配置"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:79
msgid "Results"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:81
msgid "After configuration completes, the following files are generated:"
msgstr "配置完成后，将生成以下文件："

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md
msgid "Generated Configuration Files"
msgstr "生成的文件"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:97
msgid "Internal Execution Flow"
msgstr "内部执行流程"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:99
msgid "Stage 1: Chip Configuration"
msgstr "阶段 1：芯片配置"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:100
msgid "The system reads `Kconfig.chip` — defines all hardware-related options"
msgstr "系统读取 `Kconfig.chip` — 定义所有硬件相关选项"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:101 ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:109
msgid "The user selects settings in the UI"
msgstr "用户在界面中选择设置"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:102
msgid "Output is saved to a temporary `chip.config` file"
msgstr "输出保存到临时 `chip.config` 文件"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:104
msgid "Stage 2: Pre-processing"
msgstr "阶段 2：预处理"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:105
msgid ""
"Between the two windows, `preprocess_kconfig.py` runs automatically to "
"prepare the build configuration stage."
msgstr "在两个窗口之间，`preprocess_kconfig.py` 自动运行以准备构建配置阶段。"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:107
msgid "Stage 3: Build Configuration"
msgstr "阶段 3：构建配置"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:108
msgid "The system reads `Kconfig.build` — defines software and project settings"
msgstr "系统读取 `Kconfig.build` — 定义软件和项目设置"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:110
msgid "Output is saved to a temporary `build.config` file"
msgstr "输出保存到临时 `build.config` 文件"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:112
msgid "Stage 4: Merging"
msgstr "阶段 4：合并"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:113
msgid "Both stages are combined into the final `.config`:"
msgstr "两个阶段合并为最终的 `.config`："

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:119
msgid ""
"This merged file contains the complete system configuration (both "
"hardware and software) and is used by the compiler and the Pinmux tool."
msgstr "此合并文件包含完整的系统配置（硬件和软件），供编译器和 Pinmux 工具使用。"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:121
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:123
msgid "Arrow Keys Not Working in Windows PowerShell / VS Code"
msgstr "Windows PowerShell / VS Code 中方向键无法使用"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:125
msgid "Use letter keys instead (`j`/`k` for up/down movement)"
msgstr "改用字母键（`j`/`k` 上下移动）"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:126
msgid "Use Windows 11"
msgstr "使用 Windows 11"

#: ../../source/tools/menuconfig.md:127
msgid "Use CMD instead of PowerShell"
msgstr "使用 CMD 替代 PowerShell"
